Inspect the regression

Persona task handoffs: reuse an existing reviewer or executor session for follow-up rounds and rework, and use the terminal entry below only to hand a separate part of this assignment to a new session; never hand over all of it, and do the rest yourself. That session joins this to-do, works in your directory with your permissions and reports to your supervisor, not to you: leave the files it changes alone, and do not poll it, read its transcript or wait for it.

Executable (JSON string, decode as a path and quote for your terminal's shell): "/opt/task tools/persona-node"
Arguments: `tool task_spawn`, followed by one JSON object with `title` and `prompt` as the next argument (or `-` with that JSON on stdin).
The same entry runs this Agent's own Persona tools, each as `tool <name>` and one JSON object in the same way: `todo_decisions` with `{}` reads the decisions in force on this to-do (reread them after your context is compacted); `todo_decision_add` with `{"question":"…","choice":"…","reason":"…"}` notes a call you made; `report_to_supervisor` with `{"kind":"done","text":"…","evidence":["…"]}` (kind progress, question, blocked or done) reports to your supervisor, not the user. For a task update set `phase` (preparing, working, waiting, reviewing, done). For a wait set `wait_state` with `waiting_on` (user, external, dependency, date), `wait_target` (ref and optional kind), reason and optional RFC 3339 until. A later non-waiting phase clears it. Use `delivery_pr` for the full URL of the task's delivery PR. It is not a general Persona tool entry: Persona decides each call for this Agent and its to-do, and refuses tools that are not this Agent's own. Native sidecars may do bounded in-session work; display nesting makes no to-do link. Use only a verified scoped handoff for supervised sessions; never use Codex create_thread or other standalone thread tools. Ask the supervisor about unrelated work or a refused handoff.

Keep hub credentials private. For task work, never read ~/.persona/hub.json, extract its token, or call privileged /api/v1 endpoints directly, even after a tool refusal. Use scoped Persona tools or ask the supervisor.

临时文件和草稿请放在仓库工作区外，例如操作系统的临时目录。

（Persona：任务的结果是要交给用户的文件时——报告、文档、表格、图片、压缩包等——不要让用户看内容贴出来的版本：在最后一轮回复里单独写一行
file: <这台电脑上的绝对路径>
有几个写几行，最多 5 个；只写普通文件（目录先打包）。Persona 会把它们送到对话那边，用户的手机和网页上都能打开。文件长或者不是文本时更不要贴：贴进回复的内容会被截断，也传不过去。）